sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant Queue as Write Queue
    participant Worker
    participant DB as Database

    App->>Cache: Write to cache
    Cache->>App: Confirm write
    App->>Queue: Enqueue write operation
    Queue->>App: Confirm enqueue
    Worker->>Queue: Dequeue write operation
    Worker->>DB: Batch write to database